    ("What is Type Inference and how does the Hindley-Milner algorithm work in Rust and Haskell?", "Advanced", "Infers most general principal types for all expressions without explicit annotations; uses unification algorithm to solve constraint equations across syntax trees."),
    ("How does Instruction Scheduling reorder assembly instructions to avoid CPU pipeline stalls?", "Advanced", "Reorders independent instructions to fill latency delay slots (e.g. memory load latency or floating point division) while preserving data dependencies."),
    ("What is Linear Scan Register Allocation and why is it preferred over Graph Coloring in JIT compilers?", "Advanced", "Scans variable live intervals in single sequential pass allocating registers linearly; achieves $O(N)$ fast compilation speed suitable for real-time JIT compilation."),
