    ("What is the difference between Context-Free Grammars (CFG) and Regular Grammars?", "Beginner", "Regular grammars generated by finite state automata (cannot handle arbitrary nesting); Context-Free grammars generated by pushdown automata with stacks (can parse nested brackets)."),
    ("How does Loop Fusion (Loop Jamming) and Loop Fission (Loop Distribution) improve cache performance?", "Intermediate", "Fusion combines two adjacent loops over the same range into one, improving temporal cache locality; Fission splits a large loop into smaller loops to fit in cache."),
    ("What is a Symbol Table Scope Tree and how are shadows handled?", "Beginner", "Inner scope declaring variable with name matching outer scope masks the outer variable; symbol table lookups resolve to nearest active child scope node."),
