    ("What is Live Variable Analysis and how is it computed using backward dataflow equations?", "Intermediate", "A variable is live at a point if its current value may be read along some execution path before being redefined; computed backwards: $IN[B] = USE[B] \\cup (OUT[B] - DEF[B])$."),
